---
title: Pumpkin Nut Waffles
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Good Morning, Morning Glory!
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@flour{2%cups}
@baking powder{1%Tbsp}
@pumpkin pie spice{0.75%tsp}
@salt{0.25%tsp}
@egg yolks{3}
@milk{1.75%cups}
@oil{0.5%cup}
@canned pumpkin{0.5%cup}
@egg whites{3}
@chopped pecans{0.5%cup}

Thoroughly stir together flour, baking powder, pie spice and salt. Beat yolks; stir in milk, oil and pumpkin. Stir into dry ingredients. Beat egg whites to stiff peaks; fold into batter. Stir in nuts.
